### Using extension REST Client in VSCode, you can test your API endpoints by sending HTTP requests directly from a .http file. Below are examples of how to test the login and form creation endpoints of your application.
###
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=test01@gmail.com&password=123456
###

### BIẾN TỰ ĐỊNH NGHĨA (Thay giá trị thật vào đây)
@form_id = your_form_id_here
@field_id = your_field_id_here
@submission_id = your_submission_id_here
@sid = your_session_id_here 

### 1. [GET] Lấy danh sách tất cả form (Admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/forms
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}
###

### 2. [POST] Tạo form mới (Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/forms
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}

{
  "title": "Form 1",
  "description": "This is the first form.",
  "status": "active"
}
###

### 3. [POST] Thêm Field vào Form (Admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/forms/{{form_id}}/fields
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}

{
  "label": "Giới tính",
  "type": "select",
  "order": 1,
  "required": true,
  "options": ["Nam", "Nữ", "Khác"]
}
###

### 4. [PUT] Cập nhật một Field cụ thể (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/forms/{{form_id}}/fields/{{field_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}

{
  "label": "Giới tính của bạn",
  "type": "select",
  "order": 5,
  "required": false,
  "options": ["Nam", "Nữ", "Không tiết lộ"]
}
###

### 5. [DELETE] Xóa một Field khỏi Form (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/forms/{{form_id}}/fields/{{field_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}
###

### 6. [GET] Lấy danh sách form đang Active (Employee)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/forms/active
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}
###

### 7. [POST] Nộp Form (Employee)
# Lưu ý: answers gửi lên là mảng các object { fieldId, value }
POST http://localhost:3000/api/forms/{{form_id}}/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}

{
  "answers": [
    { "fieldId": "{{field_id}}", "value": "Nam" }
  ]
}
###

### 8. [GET] Lấy lịch sử nộp bài (Employee/Admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}
###

### 9. [PUT] Duyệt/Từ chối bản ghi (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/submissions/{{submission_id}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}

{
  "status": "approved",
  "adminNote": "Thông tin hợp lệ, đã duyệt."
}
###

### 10. [GET] Kiểm tra lại chi tiết Form (Admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/forms/{{form_id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: connect.sid={{sid}}
